  "prefLabel": "Env-A 622.07 Opportunity for Response",
  "priorExpiration": "2003-06-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 622.07 Opportunity for Response. The department shall make available to the applicant all written comments and requests for a public hearing upon request. Within 10 working days after the close of the public comment period specified in Env-A 622.02, the applicant may file with the department a written response to any of the written comments received during the comment period.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by 2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; EXPIRED: 6-30-03\n\nNew. #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 206.07); ss by #10175, eff -9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
